    "title": "Popular Lobster Chain Rolling into Ridgewood Next Week - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Boozy Burbs ,\n11 hours ago A fast-growing lobster roll chain known for its New England-style seafood is preparing to open in Bergen County next week. Mason’s Famous Lobster Rolls is set to open on May 20 at 111 E Ridgewood Avenue in Ridgewood, marking the brand’s second New Jersey location and first in Bergen County. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
